  abilityDesc: 14 combo massive Earth attack on all foes (enormously boosts own critical
    hit rate, damage relative to remaining HP), 3 combo Earth attack on single foe
    (consecutive uses boost damage), 50% damage reduction for 3 turns, hugely boosts
    Def, Rec relative to Atk for 3 turns, 100% boost to critical damage for 3 turns
    & 25% additional damage reduction for 3 turns
